{"name":"Bridgewater","hex":"#527065","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Bridgewater","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A surname."]},{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A common placename:\nA town in the Adelaide Hills, South Australia, Australia.\nA suburb of Hobart in Brighton council area, Tasmania, Australia.\nA locality in the Shire of Loddon, north western Victoria, Australia.\nA town in Nova Scotia, Canada.\nA number of places in the United States:\nA town in Litchfield County, Connecticut.\nA city in Adair County, Iowa.\nA town in Aroostook County, Maine.\nA town in Plymouth County, Massachusetts. \nA township in Washtenaw County, Michigan.\nA township in Rice County, Minnesota.\nA town in Grafton County, New Hampshire.\nA township in Somerset County, New Jersey.\nA town in Oneida County, New York.\nA township in Williams County, Ohio.\nA borough in Beaver County, Pennsylvania.\nA township in Susquehanna County, Pennsylvania.\nA city in McCook County, South Dakota.\nA town in Windsor County, Vermont.\nA town in Rockingham County, Virginia.","A town in the Adelaide Hills, South Australia, Australia."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Bridgewater"}],"entries":[{"title":"Bridgewater Associates","blocks":[{"text":"Bridgewater Associates, LP is an American investment management firm founded by Ray Dalio in 1975. The firm serves institutional clients including pension funds, endowments, foundations, foreign governments, and central banks. In 2025, Bridgewater's flagship fund Pure Alpha climbed 33%, its best full-year performance. The firm began as an institutional investment advisory service, graduated to institutional investing, and pioneered the risk parity investment approach in 1996."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/96/Bridgewater_Associates.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bridgewater_Associates","wikidata":"Q652431"},{"title":"Bridgewater Systems","blocks":[{"text":"Bridgewater Systems was a Canadian network management technology firm. It developed software for phone and cable companies. The firm was acquired by Amdocs in 2011."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bridgewater_Systems","wikidata":"Q4966862"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d8/Bridgewater_Associates_-_One_Glendinning_Place.jpg/500px-Bridgewater_Associates_-_One_Glendinning_Place.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d8/Bridgewater_Associates_-_One_Glendinning_Place.jpg/1280px-Bridgewater_Associates_-_One_Glendinning_Place.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d8/Bridgewater_Associates_-_One_Glendinning_Place.jpg/500px-Bridgewater_Associates_-_One_Glendinning_Place.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABridgewater_Associates_-_One_Glendinning_Place.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/9/9b/Bridgewater_Systems%2C_A_Division_of_Amdocs.jpg/330px-Bridgewater_Systems%2C_A_Division_of_Amdocs.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/9/9b/Bridgewater_Systems%2C_A_Division_of_Amdocs.jpg/330px-Bridgewater_Systems%2C_A_Division_of_Amdocs.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABridgewater_Systems%2C_A_Division_of_Amdocs.jpg"}],"sounds":{},"pictures":[{"title":"The Indian grey mongoose (Urva edwardsii) mating 4","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ca/The_Indian_grey_mongoose_%28Urva_edwardsii%29_mating_4.jpg/500px-The_Indian_grey_mongoose_%